### IAM GET TOKEN
POST {{IAM_HOST_ADDRESS}}/auth/realms/service/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id={{IAM_CLIENT_ID}}&client_secret={{IAM_CLIENT_SECRET}}

### CONNECT
GET {{HOST_ADDRESS}}/api/uhf/connect?ip=172.19.68.9&port=8888
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{IAM_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### DISCONNECT
GET {{HOST_ADDRESS}}/api/uhf/disconnect?connectionId={{CONNECTION_ID}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{IAM_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### READ
GET {{HOST_ADDRESS}}/api/uhf/read?connectionId={{CONNECTION_ID}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{IAM_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### WRITE
POST {{HOST_ADDRESS}}/api/uhf/write?connectionId={{CONNECTION_ID}}&epcCode=000000000000000000000000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{IAM_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### PRODUCTION SCAN
POST {{HOST_ADDRESS}}/api/uhf/production-scan?connectionId={{CONNECTION_ID}}&barcode=CFM258999L
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{IAM_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### WAREHOUSE STOCK IN
POST {{HOST_ADDRESS}}/api/uhf/warehouse-stock-in?connectionId={{CONNECTION_ID}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{IAM_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### WAREHOUSE STOCK OUT
POST {{HOST_ADDRESS}}/api/uhf/warehouse-stock-out?connectionId={{CONNECTION_ID}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{IAM_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### START READ
GET {{HOST_ADDRESS}}/api/uhf/start-read?connectionId={{CONNECTION_ID}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{IAM_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### STOP READ
GET {{HOST_ADDRESS}}/api/uhf/stop-read?connectionId={{CONNECTION_ID}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{IAM_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
